{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the\u00a0<u>Demo</u>\u00a0version of\u00a0<i>AutoBlobber</i>, where your strategic skills will be put to the ultimate test!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This Demo Contains:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3x Starter Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1x Starter Blob character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3x Unlockable Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3x Unlockable Blob characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5x Different Enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1x Boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless Mode past wave 15</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>The Game</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>AutoBlobber</i>, strategy is everything. You won\u2019t control movement or combat. Instead, you\u2019ll guide your Blob through wave after wave of enemies by choosing and placing upgrades between each round. Build powerful synergies, unlock enchantments, and evolve your Blob into an unstoppable force \u2014 then sit back and watch the chaos unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive as long as you can and rise on the global leaderboard.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Equip Upgrades Between Waves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/extras/Equip_Upgrades.gif?t=1746814862\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique upgrades with different abilities and target modes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/extras/Battle.gif?t=1746814862\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle countless enemies with increasing difficulty per wave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combine Upgrades Into Stronger Versions</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/extras/Combine.gif?t=1746814862\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolve your simple Upgrades into stronger versions of itself, 3 different tiers of each upgrade variant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boss Fights!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/extras/BossGiff.gif?t=1746814862\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See how your Blob can handle Bosses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Improve Existing Upgrades With Improvement Upgrades</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/extras/Improve.gif?t=1746814862\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve all upgrades of one variant with<i> &quot;improvement-upgrades&quot;</i>\u00a0that enhances the stats off all currently equipped upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Increase Your &quot;Blob-Army&quot; And See How Many Waves You Can Survive</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/extras/Exbpand_and_survive.gif?t=1746814862\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continue to play, grow, battle, and purchase new upgrades and see how many waves you can last.\u00a0  <br> <br><i>A <u>Global</u> Leaderboard will display who\u00a0the best<strong>\u00a0AutoBlobber is</strong></i>.\u00a0  <br> <br><strong>Will you be the best?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705810?t=1746814862","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705810?t=1746814862","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/24f2dc7bdc6ad72ccb447156832453064a987680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746814862","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/24f2dc7bdc6ad72ccb447156832453064a987680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746814862","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the\u00a0<u>Demo</u>\u00a0version of\u00a0<i>AutoBlobber</i>, where your strategic skills will be put to the ultimate test!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This Demo Contains:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3x Starter Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1x Starter Blob character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3x Unlockable Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3x Unlockable Blob characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5x Different Enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1x Boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless Mode past wave 15</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>The Game</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>AutoBlobber</i>, strategy is everything. You won\u2019t control movement or combat. Instead, you\u2019ll guide your Blob through wave after wave of enemies by choosing and placing upgrades between each round. Build powerful synergies, unlock enchantments, and evolve your Blob into an unstoppable force \u2014 then sit back and watch the chaos unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive as long as you can and rise on the global leaderboard.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Equip Upgrades Between Waves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/extras/Equip_Upgrades.gif?t=1746814862\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique upgrades with different abilities and target modes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/extras/Battle.gif?t=1746814862\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle countless enemies with increasing difficulty per wave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combine Upgrades Into Stronger Versions</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/extras/Combine.gif?t=1746814862\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolve your simple Upgrades into stronger versions of itself, 3 different tiers of each upgrade variant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boss Fights!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/extras/BossGiff.gif?t=1746814862\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See how your Blob can handle Bosses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Improve Existing Upgrades With Improvement Upgrades</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/extras/Improve.gif?t=1746814862\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve all upgrades of one variant with<i> &quot;improvement-upgrades&quot;</i>\u00a0that enhances the stats off all currently equipped upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Increase Your &quot;Blob-Army&quot; And See How Many Waves You Can Survive</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/extras/Exbpand_and_survive.gif?t=1746814862\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continue to play, grow, battle, and purchase new upgrades and see how many waves you can last.\u00a0  <br> <br><i>A <u>Global</u> Leaderboard will display who\u00a0the best<strong>\u00a0AutoBlobber is</strong></i>.\u00a0  <br> <br><strong>Will you be the best?</strong></p>","developers":["Pancake Lab"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3240250","name":"AutoBlobber"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705810/e55af8c2877c51de526dbfabe86baab2d824d076/header.jpg?t=1746814862","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132950,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132950/movie480.mp4?t=1746814860","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132950/movie_max.mp4?t=1746814860"},"name":"GamePlay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132950/cb81a5bc00784593ee553da2e8ea110c8456777f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746814860","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132950/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746814860","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132950/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746814860"}}],"name":"Auto Blobber Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 or AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 / AMD Radeon R5 series<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> -<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> May run on lower-end systems but with potential frame rate drops in heavy wave scenarios.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Proces